  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you successfully damage the analyzed creature, they must succeed at a Fortitude saving throw or have their movement speeds halved for 1 round and be unable to 5-foot step during this time.</p>\n<p>You can expend this application as part of successfully damaging the analyzed creature, forcing them to attempt a Fortitude saving throw. On a failure, they become exhausted for 1 round, plus 1 round per 5 ranks in the associated skill you possess. On a successful save, they become fatigued for the duration instead.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
